  "The shoreline I gazed upon that day",
  "I still recall it",
  "The words etched into the sand",
  "Your silhouette from behind",
  "The returning waves",
  "brush my feet and snatch something away",
  "Within the evening calm",
  "Only dusk passes by",
  "Suddenly flashed and blossomed",
  "I was watching fireworks",
  "Surely still",
  "The summer that never ends",
  "My vague heart",
  "Melted and tied together",
  "This night",
  "I wished it would continue",
  "",
  "“How many more times can I watch the same fireworks with you?” she thought",
  "What can I do for that smiling face",
  "To be hurt, to rejoice",
  "The repeating waves and emotions",
  "Restlessness, the sound of the last train",
  "As many times as needed",
  "I’ll speak your name",
  "Choose the tide again",
  "So that we never have to be sad again",
  "",
  "When I gasp sharply",
  "a light that seems about to vanish",
  "surely still lived in my chest",
  "",
  "If I reach out, I could touch it",
  "The warm future",
  "was quietly watching the two of us",
  "",
  "Suddenly fireworks",
  "bloomed in the night",
  "blooming in the night",
  "faded silently",
  "Don’t go away",
  "Just a little longer",
